            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A modular note taking system comprising a support surface configured to support a plurality of writing surfaces each having an elongated slot. The system also includes an elongated binding element configured to retain the plurality of writing surfaces when received by the elongated slot of the writing surface. The system further includes a pad coupled with the support surface, wherein the pad has a retainment member configured to couple with the at least one binding element.</p>
            </abstract>
